Lab 10: Helm and GitOps
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Understand the fundamentals of GitOps methodology and its benefits
Install and configure Helm package manager for Kubernetes
Set up a local Kubernetes cluster using kind (Kubernetes in Docker)
Install and configure ArgoCD for GitOps continuous delivery
Create Helm charts for application deployment
